  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "The formula expressing the relationship between \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) in the table is:\n\n  \\(x\\)  \\(2\\)  \\(3\\)  \\(4\\)  \\(5\\)  \\(6\\)\n\n  \\(y\\)  \\(0\\)  \\(2\\)  \\(6\\)  \\(12\\)  \\(20\\)",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(y=2x-4\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(y=x^2-3x+2\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\(y=x^3-3x^2+2x\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "D",
      "text": "\\(y=x^2-4x\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "E",
      "text": "\\(y=x^2-4\\)"
    }
  ],
  "answer": {
